# The generated targetSdk 35 proxy runs as untrusted_app. WildKSU 3.1.2
# does not provide Next's domain-to-su socket grant. Permit only connection;
# Broker still authenticates peer UID, one package, signing certificate and
# live parent/profile serials before accepting its fixed PROBE/LAUNCH verbs.
# This grants no shell, file, Binder, socket read/write or permissive access.
allow untrusted_app su unix_stream_socket connectto
